        "# Native containers\n\n9) A wrapping ordered item with **strong** and `code`.\n10) Mixed children:\n    - Nested bullet\n    - > Quoted *text*\n      > with a hard break.  \n      > Next line.\n\n> ## A quoted heading\n>\n> A paragraph inside a quote.\n>\n> - Tight item\n> - Another item\n>\n> ~~~\n> literal code\n> ~~~\n\n- A loose item\n\n  A second paragraph.\n\n- Another loose item\n\n>\n\n-\n",
